		describe_en = 'Kyurem breathes ice, making icicles in the air to attack, dealing (#C0xE69900#180% P.ATK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*60)$) #C0xF13B54#P.DMG#C0x5B545B# to the enemy. Gains a 【Thrill Shield】 for 2 rounds (When attacked, grabs 10% of Max HP from the attacker (capped at 10% of self Max HP) and transfer 1 negative effect) \n#F10# \n#F40#Applies the 【Crush】 status to the target for 2 rounds if it has the 【Hunted】 status (Crush: Negative effect, blocks healing and causes the target to take True DMG equal to 80% of Kyurem\'s P.ATK when it attacks)',
